{
    "interface_version": 2,
    "name": "MaaShiningNikki",
    "description": "闪耀暖暖小助手",
    "contact": "",
    "license": "MIT",
    "welcome": "# 公告\n\n**闪现吧暖暖不会修改任何游戏数据，仅通过视觉算法与模拟键鼠运行，理论上不会被封号。**\n\n**但本质仍属于第三方程序，有被检测到的风险，后果请自行承担**",
    "github": "https://github.com/7iko-07/MaaShiningNikki",
    "version": "v0.0.11-nightly.20260922",
    "title": "闪现吧暖暖v0.0.11#9.22 - 一叶灼春#9.22",
    "icon": "logo.ico",
    "mirrorchyan_multiplatform":false,
    "agent": {
        "child_exec": "python",
        "child_args": [
        "-u",
        "./agent/main.py"
        ]
    },
    "controller": [
        {
            "name": "安卓端",
            "type": "Adb",
            "display_short_side": 720
        }
    ],
    "resource": [
        {
            "name": "官服",
            "path": [
                "./resource"
            ]
        }
    ],
    "group": [
        {
            "name": "日常任务"
        },
        {
            "name": "周常任务"
        }
    ],
    "task": [
